## Title: CasualClean
## Author: Th3rtythr33
## Version: 1.3.0
## AddOnVersion: 7
## APIVersion: 101050
## Description: A more minimal, immersive HUD. Hides the companion unit frame (name/health bar) and marks your companion with a follower icon over their head that shifts from green to yellow to red as their health drops, showing an X if they die. When they're off-screen, the icon clamps to the screen edge and an arrow points toward them. Automatically disables itself in Cyrodiil and Battlegrounds always, and in Dungeons/Trials while grouped.

CasualClean.lua
